# Brainfuck AArch64 extended bounded ELF wrapper
# Input starts with an unsigned native slot count
# Every input slot contains forty eight binary bytes
# The maximum count is seventy four slots
# All machine image bytes are emitted by this BF program
# The entry and loader headers match the earlier verified image
# The empty slots receive safe native no operation instructions
# The final two output bytes carry framing and status
# Loop relocations are not applied by this stage
